1. Substitute $x = 7$ into the expression:
   $$
   3x^2 + 5x - 1 \rightarrow 3(7)^2 + 5(7) - 1
   $$

2. Compute $7^2 = 49$:
   $$
   3(49) + 5(7) - 1
   $$

3. Multiply:
   $$
   147 + 35 - 1
   $$

4. Add and subtract:
   $$
   147 + 35 = 182
   $$
   $$
   182 - 1 = 181
   $$

